ة من الوجه الخلفي (Bifacial Gain)","معامل تدهور أداء منخفض سنويًا"}	{"High-efficiency silicon cells","Reinforced aluminum frame for wind and load resistance","Extra energy yield from the rear side (Bifacial Gain)","Low annual performance degradation rate"}	{"Células de silicio de alta eficiencia","Marco de aluminio reforzado resistente al viento y a las cargas","Rendimiento adicional gracias a la cara posterior (Ganancia Bifacial)","Baja tasa de degradación anual del rendimiento"}	{高效硅电池片,"加固铝合金边框,抗风抗载",背面发电带来额外收益(双面增益),年功率衰减率低}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
