rts operation with or without batteries, 150% unbalanced loads, and parallel connection for up to 6 units. Durability: Rated IP65 for dust and water resistance, with an operating temperature range of -25°C to 60°C. Smart Features: Includes built-in WiFi monitoring, multiple communication ports (BMS/CAN/RS485), and smart load management.	VEICHI VLT series (12K-H/15K-H) Model & Power: The VEICHI VLT series (12K-H/15K-H) provides rated outputs of 12,000W and 15,000W for off-grid or hybrid use. Performance: Features dual MPPT trackers supporting up to 1000V DC input and 96% maximum conversion efficiency. Flexibility: Supports operation with or without batteries, 150% unbalanced loads, and parallel connection for up to 6 units. Durability: Rated IP65 for dust and water resistance, with an operating temperature range of -25°C to 60°C. Smart Features: Includes built-in WiFi monitoring, multiple communication ports (BMS/CAN/RS485), and smart load management.	Serie VEICHI VLT (12K-H/15K-H) Modelo y potencia: La serie VEICHI VLT (12K-H/15K-H) ofrece potencias nominales de 12,000W y 15,000W para uso off-grid o híbrido. Rendimiento: Cuenta con dos rastreadores MPPT que admiten hasta 1000V de entrada de CC y una eficiencia de conversión máxima del 96%. Flexibilidad: Admite funcionamiento con o sin baterías, cargas desequilibradas del 150% y conexión en paralelo de hasta 6 unidades. Durabilidad: Clasificación IP65 contra polvo y agua, con un rango de temperatura de funcionamiento de -25°C a 60°C. Funciones inteligentes: Incluye monitoreo WiFi integrado, múltiples puertos de comunicación (BMS/CAN/RS485) y gestión inteligente de cargas.	VEICHI VLT系列(12K-H/15K-H)型号与功率:VEICHI VLT系列(12K-H/15K-H)提供12,000瓦和15,000瓦的额定输出,适用于离网或混合系统。性能:配备双路MPPT跟踪器,支持最高1000V直流输入,最大转换效率达96%。灵活性:支持有电池或无电池运行、150%不平衡负载,以及最多6台并联连接。耐用性:IP65防尘防水等级,工作温度范围为-25°C至60°C。智能功能:内置WiFi监控、多种通信接口(BMS/CAN/RS485)及智能负载管理。	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
